A '''twisted potion''' is a [[combat]] [[potions|potion]] that boosts the player's [[Ranged]] and [[Defence]] levels by 5 + 13% of their base levels. It can be made with 59 [[Herblore]] by using a [[golpar]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[cicely]] in the inventory.

This potion is the standard variant of the twisted potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

==Effects==
Ranged boost is calculated with: <math>\lfloor RangedLevel \times \frac{13}{100} \rfloor + 5</math>
